37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that quote is painful. But the billing shows we pay for empty desks too, so we must fill the space efficiently.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, the shuffles dragged on for two weeks each time. I’m terrified of losing my morning gaps again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the physio note says a good setup takes days to settle. Moving desks resets that clock every time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, those two weeks of chaos are exactly what I feared. We must avoid that disruption.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, if we pay for empty space, we should consolidate. Fewer desks means less to re-run and less to waste.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need to stop paying for empty space and pick a layout that won’t need changing again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
