44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, exactly. My body needs time to adjust. Frequent moves would leave me in constant discomfort.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I found the badge records show some arrive before eight and others after ten. First-come seating would be unfair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
