47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, agreed. Assigned seats prevent the chaos, but we must ensure the layout is permanent to avoid those re-run costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, the arrival times prove that random seating is impossible. We need a fixed plan that respects everyone’s schedule.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
